among the demigod children of queen  marika the eternal  none is more mysterious than mikala the  unalloyed  not only is he not an enemy in the game  yet  but he is described by melania to be the  most fearsome of all the imperials  and so mysterious is he  that even sir gideon the all-knowing  knows very little about him  but what do we know about mikala  well we know a few things  mikala and his twin sister melania are  emperians  which means they were born from a single  god  and that god is marika and ranigan who  are one and the same  and like his twin melania mikhaila is  also cursed  while melania suffers from the scarlet  rot  mikala suffers from eternal youth  but this did not stop both siblings from  becoming fearsome demigods  while melania would become undefeated  with her blade  mikala would seek knowledge  he created an incantation known as the  discus of light  and gifted them to his father ratagan  the incantation that he created is  actually quite interesting as well it  appears as a simple halo of light that  does damage but it's considered an  incantation of the golden order  fundamentalists  which makes it quite unique  in the game holy incantations from the  golden order are often associated with  healing and curing status ailments and  the few incantations they have that  focus on the offense  are made specifically for those who  oppose the golden order  for instance orders blade and litany of  proper death is meant to deal with those  who live in death while the discus of  light works well with any creature  making the incantation somewhat unique  radigan would return the favor by  gifting mikala with another incantation  known as radigan's rings of light an  incantation that seems like an enhanced  version of the discus of light but  instead of it being fired it appears  from the caster's body instead  unfortunately this wasn't what mikala  was expecting  despite all the healing incantations the  order had  none of them would work on melania'