 the  round table hold you will be attacked by  enshaw for having the first half of the  medallion  after slaying him and talking with  guinean he will tell you to seek out  latina  as an apology for the whole business  with insha  and as mentioned upon meeting latina she  will tell you the location of the second  half of the medallion which is deep in  castle seoul  she will also implore you to take her  with you to make a less hailing tree  but what does the village of the  albanorics have to do with the hailik  tree  well some of the albanorics were led to  the healing tree by royal knight loretta  in order to have them settle there as a  safe new home  and it might have been heard that left  half of the medallion in the village  a mistake for drew those who would seek  nicholas favor  and it is here that he would begin his  research and experiments on quelling the  scarlet rot  but the rot isn't so easily removed as  it is no ordinary disease  it is a curse from an unnamed outer god  beings of great power that can influence  the lands between  in fact the golden order serves an outer  god  known as the greater will but since the  greater will could not help his sister's  rotting body michaela would use his own  power to do so  michelle would create analog gold  needles which would ward away the  meddling of outer gods  the perfect version of these needles  could even be used to cheat faith  and completely render its bearer immune  to the will of an outer god  this would ultimately grant relief to  those affected by the scarlet rot  albeit only temporary it would not  completely take away the rot nor would  it cure it  it would simply abate it  still  it says a lot about nicola's  capabilities for him to be able to go  against the outer gods  but what else do we know about his  capabilities  well interestingly  mikala has an ability to make others  infatuated with him making them faithful  towards him  it is unsure if this ability is due to  his curse or if it's 