e heilig tree alone  these two events melania's slumber and  michaelis kidnapping actually hindered  their growth into godhood  as both siblings were closest to  becoming gods  melania only needed to bloom once more  and mikala needed to awake from his  transformation  lastly there was actually some cut  content about saint trina you might have  noticed some items in the game that goes  by the prefix saint trina such as saint  trina's arrows sword lily and a torch  in that cut content it was revealed that  saint trina and mikala were one in the  same  and those infatuated with saint trina  would eventually find their way to serve  mikala  sir gideon is still unsure what to do  with the cocoon of mikala  but should he wake from his slumber  to find all his siblings now perished  and a new elden lord crowned  what horrors could the most fearsome of  the imperials do  hey everyone arlun here thank you so  much for watching i am absolutely in  love with the world of elden ring and  i'm planning to make more of these lore  videos for the channel don't worry about  gentian that is still coming once the  next patch drops but with regards to the  video that is basically all i found out  with mikala the unalloyed he is so  interesting as a demigod i  want to see more of him and hopefully  maybe he has something to do with the  age of absolute ending if it's real  if you know anything else about mikala  that i missed please let me know in the  comments down below i really want to  know more about mykola or if i made a  mistake feel free to leave a comment  about that as well but yeah i am going  to be making a little more elven ring  content so if you like that please don't  forget to like and subscribe and as  always thank you for watching
 

